{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55513","headline":"咏柳 · 罗隐","name":"咏柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"袅袅和烟映玉楼，半垂桥上半垂流。\n今年渐见枝条密，恼乱春风卒未休。\n（见蜀何光远《监诫录》卷七《亡国音》。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷六六三收隐《柳》诗，系据《甲乙集》卷九所录，与最早记载本诗的《监诫录》相较，有十三字不同。\n今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}